==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Build up your Worker Cat, then start to use [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] or [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] to take down the Metal Hippoes. Since Artist Cat is anti-Angel, you can use him against the Gabriels while something strong like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] takes them down.

You can use critical hitters like [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat]] to get rid of Metal Hippoe and use Artist Cat for the Gabriels. Stack [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to get rid of Gories.

